# Override for services/artifact-agent-service/Dockerfile only (BuildKit
# uses this file INSTEAD of the root .dockerignore when it's present, so it
# has to repeat the same baseline exclusions).
#
# The one difference from the root file: this service's image stages
# AGENTS.md and .opencode/ from artifacts-server's artifacts/ directory as
# seed content for the shared volume (see docker-entrypoint.sh) — so those
# two paths must NOT be excluded here, even though the rest of artifacts/
# (real, runtime-generated artifact content) still is.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out-tsc
**/.next
**/coverage
**/tmp
**/*.log

.git
.nx

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# See root .dockerignore's note — a stray committed pnpm-lock.yaml confuses
# Nx's project-graph plugin in this npm-workspaces repo.
pnpm-lock.yaml

services/artifacts-server/artifacts/**
!services/artifacts-server/artifacts/AGENTS.md
!services/artifacts-server/artifacts/.opencode
!services/artifacts-server/artifacts/.opencode/**
